id: DRAFT-tvm-ffi-0.1.12-unix-false-not-msvc-whole-archive
trigger_tool: cmake|conan|ctest
phase: testing
error_signature: 93% tests passed, 27 tests failed out of 387|Error relocating|TVMFFIError.*symbol not found|fatal.*unable to access.*github.com.*googletest.git
severity: 3
category: cmake, build-system, testing, ohos
match_keywords: hmbs_repair_method, whole-archive, not_msvc, fetchcontent_source_dir_googletest
title: stock CMake未知HarmonyOS致UNIX为假时改用NOT MSVC守卫注入whole-archive保留静态注册
root_cause: stock CMake 4.4.3无Platform/HarmonyOS模块致UNIX变量为假，if(UNIX AND NOT APPLE)守卫静默跳过--whole-archive，静态归档丢弃TVM_FFI_STATIC_INIT_BLOCK字符串查表注册；上游FetchContent写死GIT_REPOSITORY github克隆在无直连worker必然超时失败
verification_cmd: 真机预检以ctest -N取discovered加逐行Test #N计数双源核对387/389通过，readelf验证测试二进制NEEDED仅libc，前后两轮失败名单字节级对比确认守卫生效，加构建日志确认FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_GOOGLETEST跳过克隆
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: not-msvc-whole-archive-static-link
rec_description: 经replace_in_file将测试链改为静态并以if(NOT MSVC)守卫注入LINKER whole-archive同时拉入tvm_ffi_static与tvm_ffi_testing保留STATIC_INIT注册；另以vendored googletest tarball加FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_GOOGLETEST离线化FetchContent跳过github克隆
rec_command: conanfile.py: 三次replace_in_file静态化加if(NOT MSVC) whole-archive块；conandata.yml: 新增googletest tarball镜像有序列表；generate(): 置FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_GOOGLETEST与INSTALL_GTEST=OFF
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: object-library-direct-link
fallback_description: 若NOT MSVC whole-archive后仍零变化或链接器不支持该flag，改由object-library直链绕开归档丢弃，不再依赖链接器flag保留注册
affected_scope: stock CMake不识别目标平台名且需whole-archive保留静态字符串查表注册、测试依赖经FetchContent写死git克隆的CMake类C/C++库
fallback_auto_fix: false
